                                                        <p class="brfprofile">Dr. Nishant Kumar Singh is a distinguished
                                                            academic leader with over 15+ years of progressive
                                                            experience in management education, institutional
                                                            governance, and student development. He currently serves as
                                                            Dean – Examinations and Associate Professor (Marketing) at
                                                            the GNIOT Institute of Management Studies, Greater Noida,
                                                            where he plays a pivotal role in academic planning,
                                                            assessment governance, and academic quality assurance. He
                                                            has earlier contributed as Dean – Post Graduate Programme
                                                            and Area Chair Marketing, leading several academic
                                                            initiatives that strengthened program delivery and academic
                                                            outcomes.
                                                            <br>
                                                            A committed educator and mentor, Dr. Nishant Kumar Singh has
                                                            been deeply involved in curriculum innovation, pedagogical
                                                            enhancement, and student success initiatives. His teaching
                                                            and mentoring experience spans PGDM, MBA, BBA, BCA, and B.
                                                            Com programs, where he has consistently nurtured
                                                            professional competence, analytical thinking, and holistic
                                                            personality development among learners.
                                                            <br>
                                                            Beyond his core academic responsibilities, he is actively
                                                            engaged in soft skills training, career coaching, and
                                                            leadership development, empowering students to navigate
                                                            career transitions with confidence and purpose. His
                                                            mentoring approach integrates industry expectations,
                                                            personal effectiveness, and ethical values—ensuring learners
                                                            are prepared to excel professionally and contribute
                                                            meaningfully to society.
                                                            <br>
                                                            Dr. Nishant Kumar Singh holds extensive experience in
                                                            institutional administration, examination management, event
                                                            leadership, committee coordination, and faculty–student
                                                            engagement. Over the years, he has led multiple
                                                            institutional initiatives, contributed to policy
                                                            formulation, and strengthened academic processes with an
                                                            emphasis on quality and transparency.
                                                            <br>
                                                            His academic contributions include research publications in
                                                            reputed journals, participation in national and
                                                            international conferences, and continuous involvement in
                                                            curriculum development as a Board of Studies member. He
                                                            remains committed to aligning academic frameworks with
                                                            contemporary industry trends, emerging technologies, and
                                                            societal needs.
                                                            <br>
                                                            In pursuit of pedagogical excellence, Dr. Nishant Kumar
                                                            Singh has completed the renowned Case-Based Teaching Faculty
                                                            Development Programme at IIM Rohtak. His global exposure
                                                            includes delivering expert academic sessions at De Montfort
                                                            University (Dubai), Masha University (Malaysia), and Abu
                                                            Dhabi School of Management, contributing to international
                                                            knowledge exchange and academic collaboration.
                                                            <br>
                                                            Guided by a strong belief in the transformative power of
                                                            education, Dr. Nishant Kumar Singh is dedicated to shaping
                                                            future-ready, responsible, and industry-aligned management
                                                            professionals. He continues to explore opportunities for
                                                            academic collaboration, institutional partnership, research
                                                            advancement, and impactful educational initiatives.
                                                            <br>
                                                            <strong>Dr. Nishant Kumar Singh</strong>
                                                            <br>
                                                            <strong>Dean – Examinations & Associate Professor
                                                                (Marketing)</strong>
                                                            <br>
